                        "message":  "fix: address AI DevSecOps review issues 1-2 (race condition + workflow auth)\n\n- fix(DocumentBookServiceImpl): catch DataIntegrityViolationException around\n  documentRepository.save() as last-resort guard against race condition\n  when concurrent requests bypass the existsBy duplicate check\n\n- fix(DocumentWorkflowServiceImpl): role-aware data isolation for\n  getPendingSignDocuments and getPendingPublishDocuments; LEADER/ADMIN/\n  SYSTEM_ADMIN see all pending docs, REVIEWER also sees all publish-pending\n  docs, regular users see only their own (BOLA compliance)\n\n- db(migration): add unique partial index uq_documents_official_number_active\n  on documents.official_number WHERE delete_flg = false (PostgreSQL) to\n  enforce DB-level uniqueness and back the race condition protection",
